_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429740/extras/e931141aa7c44697c5e5aa10b22fa12f.avif?t=1755680536\" width=800 height=168 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nostalgic Chinese animation style, like playing games in childhood cartoons, exudes a local atmosphere.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No face to face killing, experience the eerie and thrilling gaming experience in gameplay and atmosphere.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The memories of the 1990s, the summer when watching Hong Kong horror movies, the creaking sound of elevators coming from old residential buildings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429740/extras/0daabccdb6e775566aa27bfe4c06a7de.avif?t=1755680536\" width=800 height=168 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has their own story and emotions, and when they choose their own path, the ending is already predetermined.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seeking to change one's destiny in vain Will they still be fooled by fate?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear spreads throughout everyone from the beginning, and the heart is the key to the outcome.</p></li></ul>",
